1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Welcome to Media English Study.
歡迎使用影音英語學習。

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,000
This is a short demo dialogue, not from a real movie.
這是示範對話，並非真實電影內容。

3
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:11,000
You can upload your own video or audio file.
你可以上傳自己的影片或音訊檔案。

4
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:15,500
Load English and Traditional Chinese subtitles separately or together.
可分別或一次載入英文與繁體中文字幕。

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Click any line to jump to that moment.
點擊任意一句即可跳到該時間點。

6
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:25,000
Try slowing down the playback and looping a sentence.
試試放慢播放速度，並循環某一句。

7
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:30,500
Click an English word to save it in your vocabulary list.
點擊英文字就可以加入生詞本。

8
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Practice by hiding English or Chinese when you feel ready.
準備好後，可用隱藏英文或中文的練習模式。

9
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:41,500
Shadowing mode plays a line, pauses, then plays it again.
跟讀模式會播放一句、停頓，然後再播一次。

10
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Have fun learning English with the media you love!
祝你用喜歡的影音開心學英文！
